# The sources the hasher is made of beside rahasher_jni.c, one to a line, from
# this folder: rcheevos' own; after them the two of ours that read what
# rcheevos has no reader for, a .wbfs and a .chd; and then what the second of
# those is built on, libchdr and the decompressors a .chd may be packed with.
# shared/native/build.sh, for the
# desktop, and CMakeLists.txt here, for Android, both read this list and
# compile these and no others, and link with every symbol resolved: a name
# missing here is a link error on the machine that builds, where it used to be
# a library that loaded and ended the process at the first file of the console
# left out.
#
# What of rcheevos is not here, and why: hash_encrypted.c is the 3DS, switched
# off by RC_HASH_NO_ENCRYPTED, and aes.c is used by nothing else. rc_compat.c
# and rc_util.c are the helpers of the achievement runtime, of which hashing
# calls none; rc_compat.c brought a mutex with it and so a newer C library.
#
# Of libchdr every source upstream's own build compiles is here, the codec of
# laserdisc images among them, which no file can reach: pb_chd.c refuses an
# image that names it before libchdr is given the file. Left out, its three
# functions would have to be written here under upstream's names. What of
# upstream's tree is not in the folder at all is in libchdr.version.
rcheevos/src/rhash/cdreader.c
rcheevos/src/rhash/hash.c
rcheevos/src/rhash/hash_disc.c
rcheevos/src/rhash/hash_rom.c
rcheevos/src/rhash/hash_zip.c
rcheevos/src/rhash/md5.c
pb_wbfs.c
pb_chd.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_bitstream.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_cdrom.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_chd.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_avhuff.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_cdfl.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_cdlz.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_cdzl.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_cdzs.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_flac.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_huff.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_lzma.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_zlib.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_codec_zstd.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_flac.c
libchdr/src/libchdr_huffman.c
libchdr/deps/lzma-26.02/src/LzmaDec.c
libchdr/deps/miniz-3.1.2/miniz.c
libchdr/deps/zstd-1.5.7/zstddeclib.c
